  "description": "Trail E-MTB | 160mm/140mm Travel | ACX Carbon | 29\" Wheels\n\nThe Polygon COLLOSUS TLE is our answer to delivering unmatched performance in a long-travel E-MTB, without the compromises so often seen in the gravity-electric category. Drawing inspiration from the success of our COLLOSUS N and DH models, the TLE reintroduces carbon construction and integrates our Independent Floating Suspension (IFS) system, refined to be lighter, stiffer, and more efficient than ever. With a custom-tuned ride feel and dialed-in kinematics, it meticulously balances anti-squat, anti-rise, and a progressive leverage curve to deliver precise climbing efficiency, confident braking, and plush responsiveness on every descent. Built around a full 29er platform, the TLE features Fox-tuned shocks and a versatile shock yoke for extensive adjustability. It is also future-ready, featuring a Bosch drive system with a range-extender option and a Bosch PowerMore 250Wh battery included as standard so you’re ready for all-day epics and technical alpine adventures alike.",
